brute-force or password spraying activity
index=* EventCode=4625
| stats count as failed_attempts dc(Account_Name) as unique_users values(Account_Name) as users values(Logon_Type) as logon_types by src_ip dest
| where failed_attempts >= 10
| sort - failed_attempts

This Query helps see browsers that spwan cmd lines.
index=* 
(process_name="cmd.exe" OR process_name="powershell.exe" OR process_name="pwsh.exe" OR process_name="bash" OR process_name="sh")
(parent_process_name="w3wp.exe" OR parent_process_name="httpd.exe" OR parent_process_name="nginx.exe" OR parent_process_name="apache2" OR parent_process_name="php-cgi.exe" OR parent_process_name="tomcat*" OR parent_process_name="java.exe")
| table _time host user parent_process_name process_name CommandLine
| sort - _time

Visualize hosts that have sent a large amount of data outbound in a few amount of questions.
index=* sourcetype="zeek:conn:json" | stats sum(bytes_out) as bytes_out count by src_ip dest_ip | where bytes_out > 100000000 AND count < 10 | sort - bytes_out

